---
import { Picture } from 'astro:assets';
import figure from '../assets/thermodynamic-propagation.webp';
---

<figure class="research-figure">
	<Picture
		src={figure}
		formats={['avif', 'webp']}
		widths={[720, 1200, 1800]}
		sizes="(max-width: 1180px) calc(100vw - 2rem), 1140px"
		alt="Six plots compare negative, zero, and positive BSk24 sound-speed deformations: the local signed change accumulates into pressure differences and shifts the reconstructed density and chemical-potential relations."
		loading="lazy"
		decoding="async"
	/>
	<figcaption>
		Thermodynamic propagation for representative signed deformations. The upper row shows the
		imposed sound-speed change and accumulated pressure response; the lower row shows changes in
		the reconstructed one-fluid thermodynamics. Figure from the
		<a href="https://github.com/PapathanasiouIoannis/EoS-generation/releases/tag/bsk24-campaign-data-v1.0.0">
			public campaign release
		</a>
		(CC BY 4.0).
	</figcaption>
</figure>
